# ---- editing-pass backup litter (added 2026-09-20) --------------------------------------------
# The !*.* above re-includes every dotted filename, which overrides the root .gitignore for this
# directory: measured, 24 tests/*.pre-* backups stayed visible in git status after the root rules
# were added, and git check-ignore -v named that line as the reason. The LAST matching pattern
# wins, so these must sit here, below it.
*.*.pre-*
*-backup
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak_*
*.orig
*.rej
*.old
*.notlanded
*.rejected

